    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just a little bit though, like maybe a small glass? i feel like i need the vitamin c and stuff. is it really that big of a deal if i just have a little bit in the morning? i don't want to miss out on the health benefits if it's not actually dangerous.",
