    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay i get it. i'll try and switch to orange juice then. actually i've been feeling a bit more tired and having some weird muscle aches in my legs lately... i was thinking maybe i'm just overdoing it at the gym or maybe i need more magnesium? do you think those aches could be related to the statin or is it probably just from my workouts? i'm kinda worried about calling the doctor over something that might be normal.",
