      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Muscle aches and fatigue can sometimes be side effects associated with statin use. While intense exercise can cause soreness, it's important not to ignore these symptoms when starting new medication. Because these symptoms *can* be a sign of a medication effect, it is best to mention them to your doctor at your next appointment. However, if the aches are severe or persist, you should definitely contact them sooner.",
